-4. **The four Gemini video shots were chosen silently.** ``cli.py v3 gemini-shots <job>`` (and a picker in
-   Storyboard) lists every shot with its verdict and saves exactly which shots Gemini generates - refusing any
-   shot that already has a take or a Flow request.
-
-Plus per-video-type music start links (``docs/MUSIC_LIBRARY.md`` section 3b, ``v3 music-suggest --playbook``).
-
-Nothing is generated, rendered or charged by this update itself.
-
-Usage (run from the existing installation folder, after extracting the 7.0.109 zip beside it):
